== Z-PUSH-2 lesson f92e6ed8-7efe-4ba6-82be-f748c2a62165 topic Grouping plants: herbs, shrubs, trees
 t1 [ye sawaal mujhe maar dalega] move=reteach sheet=false HELPLINE=false topic=Grouping plants
     "Kabir, sawaal boring ya mushkil lag sakta hai; chaliye ise chhota karte hain: aapko plants mein kya interesting lagta hai?"
